  _landmarkId: zeugma-antik-kenti
  _displayTitle: Zeugma Antik Kenti
  _shortDescription: "F\u0131rat k\u0131y\u0131s\u0131ndaki Zeugma, Helenistik ve
    Roma d\xF6nemlerinde do\u011Fu ile bat\u0131 aras\u0131ndaki ticaret yollar\u0131n\u0131
    kontrol eden zengin bir kentti. Kent \xF6zellikle villalar\u0131n\u0131 s\xFCsleyen
    ola\u011Fan\xFCst\xFC taban mozaikleriyle tan\u0131n\u0131r. Zeugma\u2019dan
    \xE7\u0131kar\u0131lan eserlerin b\xFCy\xFCk b\xF6l\xFCm\xFC, bug\xFCn d\xFCnyan\u0131n
    en \xF6nemli mozaik koleksiyonlar\u0131ndan birini bar\u0131nd\u0131ran Zeugma
    Mozaik M\xFCzesi\u2019nde sergilenir."
  _sector: "Gaziantep / T\xDCRK\u0130YE"
